<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50 to $1.00 lower. Trading was moderate. Top $54.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-260 lbs    53.50-54.00, near 200 head 54.50</p>
<p>		  260-270 lbs    53.00-53.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3    270-280 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>		  280-290 lbs    51.00-52.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4    290-300 lbs    50.00-51.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $1.50. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3     300-450 lbs   45.50-46.00, some selected 47.00</p>
<p>		   450-500 lbs   48.00</p>
<p>		   500-650 lbs   50.00-52.00</p>
</text>
